  { q: "Do I need TSS for Tally e-invoicing?", a: "Yes. Your TSS must be active. You also need a Tally.NET ID." },
  { q: "Which Tally version do I need for UAE e-invoicing?", a: "You need the latest TallyPrime release. UAE e-invoicing features came in recent releases, such as Release 7.1 and 7.2. Update before you start." },
