  { q: "How does a contractor bill retention in Tally?", a: "Keep retention outside the invoice total. The progress e-invoice covers the net certified amount. When the retention is released, you issue a separate e-invoice for it." },
  { q: "How do I handle returns in Tally?", a: "Issue an e-credit note linked to the original invoice. If the sale must be billed again, send a new e-invoice." },
