  { q: "What is the penalty for missing the e-invoicing deadline?", a: "Not appointing an ASP on time costs AED 5,000 for each month. After go-live, each invoice not issued electronically can cost AED 100, up to AED 5,000 a month. Credit notes have their own cap." },
  { q: "Can einvoicecost.ae set up Tally e-invoicing for me?", a: `Yes. We do the full setup for ${aed(P.help)}, one time. It covers data fixes, your EmaraTax appointment, registration, a test invoice and credit note, and fixes for rejected invoices. Or set it up yourself for free with the steps in this guide.` },
